          "text": "Témoignages: SAINT-CAPRAIS-DE-BORDEAUX (33) 15.08.2016",
          "text_sha256": "9105e3c815552f2c7888208c0e8862d545e7ee00e9f21a8d4847298f3f169ac6"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
